     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-snomed-ct-concepts</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-snomed-ct-concepts\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-snomed-ct-concepts\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/135818000\">135818000</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">General health poor</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/135817005\">135817005</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">General health fair</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/135815002\">135815002</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">General health good</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/87276001\">87276001</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Nutritional status</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/284473002\">284473002</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Mid upper arm circumference</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/315124004\">315124004</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">HIV viral load</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/129019007\">129019007</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Taking medication</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/410524007\">410524007</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Was not started</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/257622000\">257622000</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Healthcare facility</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/276052003\">276052003</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Public facilities</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/309895006\">309895006</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Private hospital<